    "hdrEnabled",
    "vrrEnabled",
    "windowMode",
    "qtRhiRenderer",
    "fontSetId",
    "fontSetSha256",
    "fontCacheState",
    "fontCachePreparationId"
  ],
  "fingerprintAlgorithm": "sha256(lowercase-key-sorted-utf8-json)",
  "notes": "The lab owns the concrete machine and font-set fingerprint allow-lists. Strict 4K60 rendering evidence is valid only when every requiredPinnedField is recorded, referenceMatch=true, and the manifest rendering values match strictRendering. HDR and VRR are disabled so Present cadence is evaluated against a fixed 60 Hz output rather than an adaptive display. The font cache is warmed by the named deterministic preparation before timed capture."
}
